@startuml View Product - Sequence Diagram

skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceMessageFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceActorFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceBoxFontName Times New Roman
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontName Times New Roman

title Sequence Diagram - Melihat Produk (Supplier)

actor "Supplier" as Supplier
participant "Filament UI" as UI
participant "Product\nResource" as Resource
participant "Product\nModel" as Product
participant "Database" as DB

== Lihat Daftar Produk ==
Supplier -> UI: Akses menu Produk
activate UI

note right of UI
    Filter otomatis:
    Hanya tampilkan produk supplier sendiri
end note

UI -> Resource: Request product list
activate Resource
Resource -> DB: Query products by supplier_id
activate DB
DB --> Resource: Product data
deactivate DB
Resource --> UI: Filtered product list
deactivate Resource
UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan daftar produk
deactivate UI

== Filter/Cari Produk ==
Supplier -> UI: Input kriteria filter:\n- Status stok\n- Status aktif\n- Keyword
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request filtered list
activate Resource
Resource -> DB: Query with filters
activate DB
DB --> Resource: Filtered data
deactivate DB
Resource --> UI: Product list
deactivate Resource
UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan hasil filter
deactivate UI

== Lihat Detail Produk ==
Supplier -> UI: Pilih produk
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request product details
activate Resource
Resource -> Product: Get product with statistics
activate Product

note right of Product
    Get complete information:
    - Basic info & stock
    - Statistics (ordered, received, rejected)
    - Acceptance rate
    - Projected stock
    - Reorder status
end note

Product -> DB: Query product data\n& related transactions
activate DB
DB --> Product: Complete data
deactivate DB
Product --> Resource: Product with full details
deactivate Product
Resource --> UI: Product detail data
deactivate Resource
UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan detail lengkap produk
deactivate UI

== Lihat Riwayat Transaksi ==
Supplier -> UI: Klik "Lihat Riwayat Transaksi"
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request transaction history
activate Resource
Resource -> DB: Query PO, Shipment, GR\nrelated to product
activate DB
DB --> Resource: Transaction data
deactivate DB
Resource --> UI: Transaction history
deactivate Resource
UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan riwayat PO, Shipment, GR
deactivate UI

== Lihat Riwayat Stok ==
Supplier -> UI: Klik "Lihat Riwayat Stok"
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request stock movements
activate Resource
Resource -> DB: Query stock movement history
activate DB
DB --> Resource: Movement data
deactivate DB
Resource --> UI: Stock movement history
deactivate Resource
UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan riwayat pergerakan stok
deactivate UI

== Lihat Grafik Trend ==
Supplier -> UI: Klik "Lihat Grafik Trend"
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request trend charts
activate Resource

note right of Resource
    Generate charts:
    - Stock trend (6 months)
    - Order trend
    - Acceptance rate trend
end note

Resource -> DB: Query historical data
activate DB
DB --> Resource: Historical data
deactivate DB

Resource -> Resource: Generate charts

Resource --> UI: Trend charts
deactivate Resource
UI --> Supplier: Tampilkan grafik trend
deactivate UI

== Export Data Produk ==
Supplier -> UI: Klik "Export Data"
activate UI
UI --> Supplier: Pilihan format (Excel/CSV)
deactivate UI

Supplier -> UI: Pilih format
activate UI
UI -> Resource: Request export
activate Resource
Resource -> DB: Query selected products
activate DB
DB --> Resource: Product data
deactivate DB

alt Format Excel
    Resource -> Resource: Generate Excel file
else Format CSV
    Resource -> Resource: Generate CSV file
end

Resource --> UI: File download
deactivate Resource
UI --> Supplier: Download data produk
deactivate UI

@enduml
